  (text "Pressure Regulator \n and Flow Sensor\n    Interfaces\n "
    (at 145.415 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.9972 2.9972)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0054869c-5822-4d01-9fb6-9da7a8ccc44e)
  )
  (text "INPUT Power: 24V (DC Barrel Jack)\n\nMIC29300 Fixed Regulator - 24V -> 12V\nMIC39101 Fixed Regulator - 12V -> 5V\nTLV76733 Fixed Regulator - 5V -> 3.3V\nOPA2310 Operational Amps - (0-5)V -> (0-3.3)V\n\nI2C (3.3V/5V) Connections:\n\nLabsmith EIB200 and 4VM02 Modules (5V)\nSparkfun MCP4725 12-bit DAC Modules (5V)\nSensirion SLI-0430FMK Flowrate Sensor (5V with Internal Level shifters)\nCG49 Digital Pressure Controllers (5V)\nOLED Display (3.3V)\n\nAnalog (5V) Connections:\n\nParker (990-005001-015) Pressure Regulator (w/ Internal Vent)\n\nMicrocontroller Module:\n\nArduino Nano 33 IoT; main processor is a Arm® Cortex®-M0 32-bit \nSAMD21 with 2.4 GHz WiFi + Bluetooth® through the NINA-W10 module"
    (at 198.755 163.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2baac3d1-73e9-4a08-8f87-8a06dec12eab)
